<title>HONG KONG: San Miguel HK 8-month net down 10 pct.</title>
<headline>San Miguel HK 8-month net down 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months ended August 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   26.0	vs 29.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0	 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  65.0 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    95.63     vs 106.78</p>
<p>    Turnover		     839.52    vs 864.53</p>
<p>    Company name		 San Miguel Brewery Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 7-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 15</p>
<p>NOTE - San Miguel Brewery, a subsidiary of San Miguel Corp of the Philippines, is a beer producer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$65 million written back to profit from provisions set aside in 1994 relating to the sale of the Sham Tseng brewery site.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
